                      %mi D
                      %mo ,
                      %mi D
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \alpha_{D,D,D}
            (defined as usual to commute with the projections) cannot be the identity.
          %p
            So, in order for coherence to work, we must change it to the statement that every “formal” diagram commutes.
            %br>/
            The formal diagrams that commute will be described through certain graphs
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
